{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2022-08-02 08:00:00', 'title': "KINETIC BY WINDSTREAM DEPLOYS CISCO AND QWILT'S OPEN CACHING SOLUTION TO ELEVATE STREAMING EXPERIENCE IN NORTH AMERICA", 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CISCO AND QWILT TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DEPLOYMENT OF THEIR UNIQUE CONTENT DELIVERY SOLUTION ACROSS THE NORTH AMERICAN NETWORK OF KINETIC BY WINDSTREAM, TO ENABLE SUPERIOR STREAMING PERFORMANCE TO ITS CUSTOMERS THROUGHOUT THE UNITED STATES. THE ADOPTION OF CISCO AND QWILT'S OPEN CACHING SOLUTION CONSIDERABLY IMPROVES THE QUALITY AND EFFICIENCY OF LIVE AND ON-DEMAND VIDEO DELIVERY WHILE INCREASING KINETIC'S NETWORK CAPACITY FOR OTHER FORMS OF MEDIA. KINETIC WIL"}